    The contribution leg is H.264 over RTMP, because that is what
    MediaLive's RTMP input accepts. The channel decodes it and encodes
    HEVC into the ARCHIVE output group, so the .ts segments in S3 - the
    thing the task asks to record - are HEVC. See 06-s3-archive.log.

